    <h1>Own Your Stack</h1>
    <p class="ep-desc">One idea in plain words for Central Valley small businesses: own your stack — the tools, accounts, and systems your business runs on should answer to you, not the other way around. Plus a 10-minute homework task and a short Spanish segment.</p>
